<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80394" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πελά̆γ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>Hel.</u>
			1062
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			1436
		</span></i> :—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of the
			sea</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλύδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					701
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγκάλαι</span>
			Id.<u>Hel.</u>ll. cc. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλάξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					1438
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πελαγίαν ἅλα</span> the
				<i>broad</i> sea, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				427
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				467
			</span></i> ; of animals, <i>living in the sea</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1276
			</span></i> (lyr.) ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν δὲ θαλαττίων [ζῴων] τὰ μὲν π. τὰ
					δὲ αἰγιαλώδη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					488b7
				</span></i>
			 ; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παράγεια</span>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				602a16
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἰχθύες</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσγειοι</span>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				598a2
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῦκος π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.6.4
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱέραξ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Par.</u>
				1.211
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>out at sea, on the open sea</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				649
			</span></i>(lyr.) ; of seamen or ships, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. πλεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.39
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				101
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐπιφανῆναι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				44
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀνάγεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					2.1.17
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἄνεμοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					3.2.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> epith. of
			Poseidon, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.410.17
			</span></i> ; of Aphrodite, <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				2.37
			</span></i> ; of Isis, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				2.4.6
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοὶ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.161c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>near the sea</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τόποι</span>,
			opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσόγειοι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ π</span>., a kind of earth, <i><span class="en">
				Androm.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.928
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πελάγια: τὰ κρόταλα, ἡ δὲ ῥίνος
				πελαγία</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
